# #186: Strong + A gives the smash and Strong + B the EX special. The hidden script preset has no
# Strong button (padbridge PadPreset::Script), so this one speaks the melee preset:
# A attack, B special, LB Strong. The setup fills Thrall a's bar; styles: 3 down smash, 4 forward smash.
#! chat -dev setup quick hero thrall;meter 100
#! preset melee
# Strong + A + forward: the forward smash.
60 a stick 1 0
60 a press LB
60 a tap A 2
62 a stick 0 0
62 a release LB
#! expect a 60-63 applied attack 1 style 4
# Strong + A + down from a crouch: the down smash.
160 a stick 0 -1
166 a press LB
166 a tap A 2
170 a stick 0 0
170 a release LB
#! expect a 166-169 applied attack 2 style 3
# Strong + A with no direction: the forward smash.
260 a press LB
260 a tap A 2
262 a release LB
#! expect a 260-263 applied attack 3 style 4
# Strong + B + forward: the EX side special (Thrall's 14) for one of three segments.
360 a stick -1 0
360 a press LB
360 a tap B 2
362 a stick 0 0
362 a release LB
#! expect a 360-363 special 14
#! expect a 360-363 special EX 14
# B + forward alone: the free side special.
480 a stick 1 0
480 a tap B 2
482 a stick 0 0
#! expect a 480-483 special 14
#! absent a 470-700 special EX
# Strong held after a tap of A: the forward smash charges, so a acts later than the 56 frames of
# the uncharged one at 260 (actionable again at 316).
560 a press LB
560 a tap A 2
600 a release LB
#! expect a 560-563 applied attack 4 style 4
#! absent a 600-625 recovery down 0 actionable 1
#! expect a 626-700 recovery down 0 actionable 1
700 a capture
740 a press VIEW
810 a release VIEW
